[[Open This|Establish a Case for Change]]

---

<span style="color: #db89c8;">Establish a case for change</span>, and assess if your organization design reflects the desired behaviors, roles, and culture that you have determined are key elements to your business success.

---

Determine if the way your organization is structured and run, in terms of team formations, shift patterns, lines of reporting, decision-making procedures, and communication channels, still supports your desired business outcomes.